%% review-flight-deck level 2 — one review, start to recorded call
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor R as Reviewer
    participant M as braid mode
    participant G as local git
    participant L as ledger.py
    participant B as build_index.py
    participant V as viewer/index.html

    R->>M: /pr:braid 16 17
    M->>G: git fetch origin pr-16 pr-17
    G-->>M: two branch heads
    M->>G: git diff merge-base..head, per branch
    G-->>M: unified diffs with hunk headers
    M->>M: bucket hunks by file and line span
    M->>G: git merge-tree, per candidate pair
    G-->>M: conflicting hunks, or clean
    M-->>R: 9 shared regions, and a proposed partition

    loop one stop per contested region
        M-->>R: shared before once, each after under its number
        R->>M: a, s, or x
        M->>L: append region_verdict
        L->>L: write one line, rebuild the projection
    end

    R->>M: accept or correct the partition
    M->>L: append disposition, one per pull request
    M->>B: run the full rebuild
    B->>B: fold the ledger into a pull-request-to-pull-request join
    B-->>V: data/braid.js and data/index.json
    V-->>R: renders the proposal and the recorded calls, read-only
